  "findings": [
    "AuthProvider EUs supplies profile identity from local auth state and account-info; it does not populate nameAtLogin/profilePictureUrlAtLogin in this provider.",
    "ZGr obtains account-info via native accessInputs.readAccountInfo or account-info host fetch.",
    "Host O_ derives account identifiers from getAuthToken payload; no token yields null identifiers.",
    "vMo queries /me for name/picture when accountId and userId exist.",
    "Original profile selector uses Settings when effective identity is null."
  ],
